{"classData":[{"comment":"/**\n * @summary The films of the Videos tab: each item is a facade until a visitor clicks it.\n *\n * A facade is the film's preview image, lazily loaded, with a play control; it loads nothing from a YouTube player\n * host. A click sets `activeId`, and only the active item renders the `youtube-nocookie.com` player, so opening\n * another film removes the previous player: at most one plays. The search field filters the store by `name`, and\n * the matches get highlighted.\n * @class Portal.view.news.videos.List\n * @extends Neo.list.Base\n */","meta":{"filename":"List.mjs","lineno":5,"columnno":0,"path":"/Users/tobiasuhlig/.neo-ai/agents/neo-opus-vega/neomjs/pages/node_modules/neo.mjs/apps/portal/view/news/videos","code":{},"srcPath":"apps/portal/view/news/videos/List.mjs"},"summary":"The films of the Videos tab: each item is a facade until a visitor clicks it.\n\nA facade is the film's preview image, lazily loaded, with a play control; it loads nothing from a YouTube player\nhost. A click sets `activeId`, and only the active item renders the `youtube-nocookie.com` player, so opening\nanother film removes the previous player: at most one plays. The search field filters the store by `name`, and\nthe matches get highlighted.","kind":"class","name":"List","augments":["Neo.list.Base"],"memberof":"Portal.view.news.videos","longname":"Portal.view.news.videos.List","scope":"static","$longname":"Portal.view.news.videos.List","$kind":"class","id":1406,"neoClassName":"Portal.view.news.videos.List"},{"comment":"/**\n     * Formats the ISO publication dates, in UTC so that a date never shifts by a day\n     * @member {Intl.DateTimeFormat} dateFormat\n     * @static\n     */","meta":{"filename":"List.mjs","lineno":21,"columnno":4,"path":"/Users/tobiasuhlig/.neo-ai/agents/neo-opus-vega/neomjs/pages/node_modules/neo.mjs/apps/portal/view/news/videos","code":{},"srcPath":"apps/portal/view/news/videos/List.mjs"},"description":"<p>Formats the ISO publication